<title>USA: First Financial to buy back 5 pct of stk.</title>
<headline>First Financial to buy back 5 pct of stk.</headline>
<dateline>STEVENS POINT, Wis. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Financial Corp said Tuesday it intends to repurchase up to 1,850,000 of its shares, or five percent of the total outstanding, between now and March 31, 1998.</p>
<p>The company's first repurchase program expired recently. A total of about 1.4 million shares, or 75 percent of the amount authorized, were repurchased, or about 3.8 percent of the shares outstanding at the start of the program.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
